# --- CQ / cq-cross-slice-compose-model-serving ------------------------------ #
ex:cqCrossSliceComposeModelServing a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQueryFile "slices/extensions/preference/queries/competency/cq-cross-slice-compose-model-serving.rq" ;
    gmeow:cqDataFile "examples/model-delta-worked.ttl" ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqCrossSliceComposeModelServingShape ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "GMEOW must answer 'does the preference slice compose an externally-supplied, content-addressed base model artifact by reference?' (Principle 16). The model-delta-worked scene joins the delta to its base checkpoint (ex:baseCkpt, typed gmeow:ModelArtifact by the model-serving slice in the fixture) via gmeow:deltaBaseArtifact, and the query binds it on the CORE seam the reuse rides — gmeow:contentDigest, without which the delta's identity tuple is not reproducible (AC5). The query must NOT name gmeow:ModelArtifact: a competency query is a semantic dependency edge (purrdf EdgeKind::Query), so naming a sibling extension's class would be the forbidden extension -> extension crossing. The asserted answer is exactly that one row." ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqCrossSliceComposeModelServingRow .
ex:cqCrossSliceComposeModelServingShape a logic:ResultShape ;
    logic:declaresColumn [ logic:columnVariable "delta" ; logic:columnTermKind logic:TermKindIri ; logic:columnBinding logic:BindingRequired ] ;
    logic:declaresColumn [ logic:columnVariable "baseArtifact" ; logic:columnTermKind logic:TermKindIri ; logic:columnBinding logic:BindingRequired ] ;
    logic:shapeCardinality logic:RowsExact .
ex:cqCrossSliceComposeModelServingRow a gmeow:ExpectedRow ;
    gmeow:rowCell [ a gmeow:ExpectedCell ; gmeow:cellVar "delta" ; gmeow:cellValueIri exd:delta1 ] ;
    gmeow:rowCell [ a gmeow:ExpectedCell ; gmeow:cellVar "baseArtifact" ; gmeow:cellValueIri exd:baseCkpt ] .

